", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The preset is copied into the save when a run starts so changing mod settings later never alters a run in progress; Standard is exactly the XML config."}, {"id": "wavesurvivalreforged_readme_runstats", "label": "RunStats and best-run records", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "WaveSurvivalReforged/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The best-runs list lives in the mod settings file and gameplay never reads it, keeping it cosmetic rather than a progression system."}, {"id": "wavesurvivalreforged_readme_wavehud", "label": "WaveHud and alerts", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "WaveSurvivalReforged/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "wavesurvivalreforged_readme_wavevignette", "label": "WaveVignette (1.7 shader effect)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "WaveSurvivalReforged/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "wavesurvivalreforged_readme_scenpart_wavesurvivalstoryteller", "label": "ScenPart_WaveSurvivalStoryteller", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "WaveSurvivalReforged/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "wavesurvivalreforged_readme_thoughtworker_stillalive", "label": "Still alive mood buff", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "WaveSurvivalReforged/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "wavesurvivalreforged_readme_build", "label": "Dual-target build (net472 + .NET 10)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "WaveSurvivalReforged/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "capt